      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapMethod on MultiPackResourceManager.getResourceStack (getResourceStack): remembered misses per namespace FallbackResourceManager when every pack of the namespace is an immutable archive without filters: FilePackResources, PathPackResources whose root is in a read-only zip file system or in securejarhandler's union file system made from a jar (UnionFileSystem.getPrimaryPath(), public and exported, read by a public method handle), VanillaPackResources with all roots in archives, CompositePackResources of such packs (helper bons.furious.patch.vanilla_resource_stack_c49.ResourceStackMisses); read-only views (duck interfaces in bons.furious.patch.vanilla_resource_stack_c49.RsStackViews) on FallbackResourceManager, its PackEntry record, PathPackResources, VanillaPackResources and CompositePackResources. Elysium API 2.0.1's conditional-asset wrapper in FallbackResourceManager.getResourceStack is audited",
